          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(217, 138, 33, 1)" fontSize="18.0" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">核心困难：ground truth 缺失</span></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="466.0559842519685" height="172.8" topLeftX="423.36" topLeftY="187.20000000000002" type="text" id="bep">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <ul listStyle="pptx-bullet">
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">普通 BCI 可以用行为结果作 ground truth；意识 BCI 恰恰缺这把标尺。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">一个生理信号可能只对应注意、觉醒、感觉加工或运动准备，而不等于 conscious experience。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">刺激报告本身会改变脑活动，因此需要 no-report paradigm。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">约束条件：masking、注意力操控、no-report、跨模态验证。</span></p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </content>
